  "question": {
    "text": "A progressive wave moving along $x$ -axis is represented by $y=A \\sin \\left[\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\lambda}(v t-x)\\right]$ The\r\nwavelength $(\\lambda)$ at which the maximum particle velocity is 3 times the wave velocity is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{A}}{A}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$2 \\mathrm{A}(3 \\pi)$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right) \\pi A$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$(2 / 3) \\pi A$",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$y=A \\sin \\left[\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\lambda}(v t-x)\\right]$\r\n$v=\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\lambda} V A$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\\left(v_{p}\\right)_{\\max } &=3 v \\\\\r\n\\lambda &=\\frac{2 \\pi}{3} A\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$"
  }
}